# Infrastructure context

Read `AGENTS.md` before work. This repo owns VM and Mac operations; website application
code belongs in `personal-website-handler`. Treat `ops/` as the deployable source of truth.
Never copy secrets into commands, commits, logs, or chat output. Verify every VM mutation
with service health and public HTTPS checks.
